#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""chezmoi modify script for ~/.claude/settings.json.

Owns the curated subset of keys in MANAGED below; everything else on
disk passes through untouched. This lets the fireworks CLI tooling on
the work machine rewrite its env/model keys (ANTHROPIC_*, model
routing) without fighting chezmoi, while hooks, permissions, status
line, plugins, and personal prefs stay synced across machines.

Merge semantics: dicts merge per-key, arrays are replaced wholesale.
Deleting a key from MANAGED does NOT remove it from disk.

Notable exclusions (left to each machine / fireworks):
  - env.ANTHROPIC_* and CLAUDE_CODE_SUBAGENT_MODEL (fireworks CLI)
  - "model" (fireworks owns model routing on the work machine)
  - installMethod, enabledMcpjsonServers, disabledMcpjsonServers
    (machine-local state)

Workflow: edit MANAGED here, review with
  chezmoi diff ~/.claude/settings.json
then apply with
  chezmoi apply ~/.claude/settings.json
"""

